00:27:57,085 --> 00:27:59,505
I used to use 15 minutes after the market opens,

472
00:27:59,505 --> 00:28:02,194
but there has been an adjustment to Quant Trading App

473
00:28:02,194 --> 00:28:04,883
this summer where it aggregates and caches the profile just

474
00:28:04,883 --> 00:28:12,145
a couple minutes after the market opens because sometimes 15 minutes might be a little bit too long for days in which the price action moves very quickly.

475
00:28:12,685 --> 00:28:15,333
And I've spoken to some of you traders and you

476
00:28:15,333 --> 00:28:20,629
guys, some of you actually do like to trade within the first 15 minutes. So that's why this was actually adjusted.

477
00:28:20,895 --> 00:28:24,460
There are some other updates that are coming to Quant Trading App over the next couple

478
00:28:24,460 --> 00:28:26,385
months. Stay tuned for those.

479
00:28:26,385 --> 00:28:29,030
Again, link is in the description to Quant Trading App.

480
00:28:29,030 --> 00:28:31,240
Thanks for watching guys. I'll catch you in the next one.

